  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "D8EAE990BCF2D5B0",
      "text": "On y est ! Le terrain de combat du Poste Polaire !\\nVise un peu ce paysage ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "D8EAEC90BCF2DAC9",
      "text": "Bon, j’en fais des caisses, mais en gros, c’est\\ncomme les autres postes, sauf que ça caille.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "D8EAEB90BCF2D916",
      "text": "Enfin, perso, le froid, ça me gêne pas, mais c’est\\npas pour autant que j’aime le type Glace.\\r\\nNon ! Moi, c’est le type Dragon qui me parle ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "D8EAEE90BCF2DE2F",
      "text": "Oups ! Je te raconte ma life, mais si t’es là,\\ncousin[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e, c’est pour le défi du Conseil 4.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "D8EAED90BCF2DC7C",
      "text": "Ici, pour mon défi, tu vas devoir participer à\\ndes [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]combats à « dômicile »[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "D8EAF090BCF2E195",
      "text": "Les règles sont simples ! Tu dois battre trois\\nmembres du Club de la Ligue ! C’est tout ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_07",
      "hash64": "D8EAEF90BCF2DFE2",
      "text": "Mais attention, y a un truc !\\nTes Pokémon doivent respecter deux conditions ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_10",
      "hash64": "D8E78490BCEFF43A",
      "text": "D’une, faut qu’ils aient été [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]capturés sous[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]le Terra-Dôme[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_12",
      "hash64": "D8E78290BCEFF0D4",
      "text": "Et de deux, [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]c’est TOI qui dois les avoir capturés[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_13",
      "hash64": "D8E78390BCEFF287",
      "text": "Si t’as des Pokémon qui répondent pas à ces\\ncritères dans ton équipe, c’est mort.\\r\\nTu pourras pas les utiliser. Pigé ?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_14",
      "hash64": "D8E78090BCEFED6E",
      "text": "Ouais, je sais, ça me ressemble pas d’imposer\\ndes règles, mais ce serait trop facile si tu pouvais\\r\\nenvoyer les bêtes de compèt’ que t’as entraînées.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 151,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_15",
      "hash64": "D8E78190BCEFEF21",
      "text": "Et si ça peut te rassurer, c’est même tarif\\npour tes adversaires.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_16",
      "hash64": "D8E77E90BCEFEA08",
      "text": "Alors cousin[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e, t’es prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e à relever mon défi\\ndu Conseil 4 ?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_01",
      "hash64": "2F6D9CFA77AE15BD",
      "text": "Je suis prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_02",
      "hash64": "2F6D99FA77AE10A4",
      "text": "Ça consiste en quoi, déjà ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_03",
      "hash64": "2F6D9AFA77AE1257",
      "text": "Non, plus tard.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_17",
      "hash64": "D8E77F90BCEFEBBB",
      "text": "Ça déchire !\\nYo, les potes ! C’est à vous ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_all_01",
      "hash64": "C7BA86F4AC3BE73F",
      "text": "\t     Salut !\\nVas-y mollo !\tJe vais gagner ![VAR 0x0114(004D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_18",
      "hash64": "D8E77C90BCEFE6A2",
      "text": "J’appelle ça un défi, mais franchement, on est\\nentre potes, pas de stress !\\r\\nÀ la cool, Parecool ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_19",
      "hash64": "D8E77D90BCEFE855",
      "text": "Si tu veux te battre direct, y a pas de souci ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_20",
      "hash64": "D8E3FE90BCECDAB1",
      "text": "Mais si tu préfères aller capturer des Pokémon\\nsous le dôme, ça nous va aussi ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_21",
      "hash64": "D8E3FD90BCECD8FE",
      "text": "C’est toi qui vois !\\nDans tous les cas, bonne chance ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_npc",
      "hash64": "9FCE05EF699E9EFA",
      "text": "Si tu veux te battre direct, ça me pose pas de\\nproblème. Mais si tu préfères aller voir ailleurs,\\r\\nzéro souci ! C’est toi qui vois ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_01",
      "hash64": "60B74CB7C5C4B4DF",
      "text": "Moi, j’adore les Pokémon gris !\\nTu veux te battre contre moi ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_04",
      "hash64": "60B747B7C5C4AC60",
      "text": "J’espère que tu vas pas faire grise mine, mais...\\ntes Pokémon respectent pas les conditions !\\c\\nReviens avec des Pokémon du Terra-Dôme que\\nt’auras capturés toi-même !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_02",
      "hash64": "60B74DB7C5C4B692",
      "text": "Hourra ! Notre combat va être grisant !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_03",
      "hash64": "60B74EB7C5C4B845",
      "text": "Bon courage pour la suite ! Je vais t’encourager\\nmême si tous tes Pokémon sont pas gris !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_01",
      "hash64": "377F54C3104234C8",
      "text": "Salut ! J’te préviens, j’suis d’humeur glaciale.\\nT’es prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e à trembler, minus ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_04",
      "hash64": "377F59C310423D47",
      "text": "Non, mais, tu t’moques de moi ?\\nTes Pokémon sont pas aux normes.\\c\\nIl te faut des Pokémon que TU as capturés, et\\nseulement sous le Terra-Dôme. Pigé ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_02",
      "hash64": "377F57C3104239E1",
      "text": "Hin hin ! Parfait. C’est parti.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_03",
      "hash64": "377F56C31042382E",
      "text": "Y fait toujours aussi froid, mais j’vais quand\\nmême rester pour t’encourager. Apprécie l’effort.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_c_01",
      "hash64": "638660C971AC4DDD",
      "text": "Je me bats avec des Pokémon du même type que\\nMashynn ! Un combat, ça te branche ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_c_04",
      "hash64": "63865BC971AC455E",
      "text": "Tes Pokémon sont pas conformes aux règles !\\nÇa va pas du tout !\\c\\nT’as pas compris ? Il faut que TU captures\\ndes Pokémon sous le Terra-Dôme !",
